            <h2 class="font-avenirBold text-t-green text-center uppercase text-3xl" >Why Tennibot?</h2>
            <p class="font-pluto text-t-off-white text-center mt-5" >We invented intelligent court training – the rest are just playing catch-up.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="w-[80%] mx-auto flex flex-row gap-20 pt-5 pb-16" >
            <div class="w-[100%] border-2 border-t-off-white rounded-xl text-left py-8 px-5" >
