                <p class="font-pluto text-t-off-white text-sm" >Since 2018, we have been building autonomous tennis robots for picking up balls and sweeping clay courts. This is not our first rodeo :)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-[100%] border-2 border-t-off-white rounded-xl text-left py-8 px-5" >
